  topic: Implementation Details by Grade Span (Superintendent)
  desc: The superintendent detailed how the policy would be implemented across different
    grade spans. Elementary students are advised to keep devices at home, or they
    will be locked in the main office; middle schoolers will have devices off and
    locked in lockers; and high schoolers will have devices collected and stored in
    lock boxes daily.
