  desc: The superintendent outlined the state-mandated exceptions to the policy, including
    uses consistent with IEPs or 504 plans, medical needs (e.g., glucose monitors),
    language support for emergent English learners, and emergency authorizations by
    administrators. These exceptions are determined on an individual case basis.
